                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d528cf9-1b93-4bfc-8c2d-107741ab840f",
                                "sense_id": "e42e7881-d701-3a43-8663-999c24df83c8",
                                "text": "Under the new policy, the big fat yellow button that turns a mouse click into a Digg vote will be dropped from posts that simply link to other sites. Only original content will be easily Diggable. (Every news article on NYTimes.com has a share tool with Digg as one of the options; blog posts like this one don’t)."
